OL,3,ARussell Brand's lack of remorse in
OL,4,Aprison message 'revolting', Miliband
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband has
OL,8,Fcalled Russell Brand's message in which
OL,9,Fhe claimed he was not guilty of the
OL,10,Foffences he's been jailed for as
OL,11,F"disgusting" and showing "no remorse".
OL,13,FBrand has been convicted of rape and
OL,14,Fthree counts of sexual assault, and is
OL,15,Fserving a 10-and-half-year sentence. He
OL,16,Fis currently being held at HMP
OL,17,FLittlehey in Cambridgeshire.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
