OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussell Brand's lack of remorse in
OL,4,Aprison message 'revolting', Miliband
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis wife Laura read out a message from
OL,8,Fhim on their Sunday Service show on
OL,9,FYouTube, in which the convicted rapist
OL,10,Fclaimed: "I am not guilty of the
OL,11,Foffences I have been jailed for."
OL,13,FThe Victims' Commissioner for London,
OL,14,FAndrea Simon, told Radio 4's Today
OL,15,Fprogramme that Brand's claims of
OL,16,Finnocence will "certainly retraumatise
OL,17,Fhis victims and other survivors of rape
OL,18,Fwho have to hear it".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
